# Defossilize: the Memnite explores, then explores again (CR 701.44a). The top card is Lightning Bolt, a nonland: the first explore gives the Memnite a +1/+1 counter and Bot1 declines to put the Bolt into
# the graveyard, so it stays on top; the second explore reveals the same Bolt (ruling 2023-11-10), gives a second counter (3/3) and this time Bot1 puts it into the graveyard. Island is revealed by nothing.
